1
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:49,500
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,260
=Episode 6=

3
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:53,719
Come take a look!

4
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:55,079
Freshly steamed buns!

5
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:59,520
Crispy scorpion! Want some?

6
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,359
If you don't want it, I'll have it.

7
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:11,599
When you're asleep, do you always

8
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:13,840
enter a dream world full of mirrors?

9
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,640
Here you go.

10
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,920
With your demon arts,

11
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:20,040
can you see into people's hearts?

12
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,640
Why are you trapped in those mirrors?

13
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,959
Want me to use my Spirit-Calling Art
to help you out?

14
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:31,319
Stop prying into my privacy.

15
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:35,480
Mind Shield.

16
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,159
Hey, you pesky Taoist!

17
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:39,519
I was actually starting to like you.

18
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,359
And now you pull
this hot-and-cold act on me?

19
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,640
I...

20
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,040
Yuanchu.

21
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,319
Senior.

22
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:52,799
Chi Xiao.

23
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:55,879
Yuanchu.

24
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:58,239
We finally found you!

25
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,760
After we got separated,

26
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,280
first a maze,

27
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,799
then quicksand.

28
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:09,800
We fought our way
through every demon in those mountains.

29
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,080
All the way to the peak.

30
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:14,000
Then we saw lights from this town.

31
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,960
Thought you might be here.

32
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:19,080
I'm just glad you're safe.

33
00:02:26,319 --> 00:02:27,439
Now that we're all together,

34
00:02:27,719 --> 00:02:28,639
let's move out.

35
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,000
The Grand Demon Hunt

36
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,120
won't wait.

37
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,639
Yuanchu. Yan.

38
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,360
I missed you both so much.

39
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,919
Let's never split up again.

40
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,319
Don't call me that.

41
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,039
It's too sweet.

42
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,879
You like it? Take it all.

43
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,159
I hereby declare

44
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:50,560
you my little junior now!

45
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Rouge over there.

46
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,159
Let me go see.

47
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,319
Tanghulu!

48
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,439
Come take a look!

49
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,840
Miss, care for some rouge?

50
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,759
So pretty.

51
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:04,879
Come over here!

52
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:11,520
Miss,

53
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:14,360
these are the latest styles.
Take a look.

54
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,319
Do you like it?

55
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,400
Fine fabric here.

56
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,039
I'll buy it for you.

57
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,520
You can't buy me off.

58
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:39,479
Lanterns!

59
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:40,879
Beautiful lanterns!

60
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:43,280
Don't you think it's strange?

61
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:46,960
This street sells things for women,

62
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,360
but I see no women.

63
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,400
Only men.

64
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,360
All food,

65
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:56,719
no beauties.

66
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:58,240
Something's off.

67
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,199
Maybe beauties
don't eat late-night snacks?

68
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:03,000
I'm sure there are women here.

69
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,639
Someone's just hiding them from us.

70
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:09,520
Lanterns! Lovely lanterns!

71
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,439
Tanghulu!

72
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,759
Kid!

73
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,519
Demon!

74
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,920
Chi Xiao!

75
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,600
Such powerful illusions.

76
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,839
We fell for it

77
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:01,920
without even noticing.

78
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,120
It's not an illusion.

79
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,560
It's the Illusion Dust.

80
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,480
She's not a demon.

81
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,519
Sir. Miss.

82
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,639
You're a girl?

83
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,399
What happened to your face?

84
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,279
I drew it myself

85
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:27,639
to scare off the bad people.

86
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,439
My name is Xiao Maizi.

87
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,240
You should leave.

88
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,439
You brought us here.

89
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:33,680
So why tell us to leave?

90
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:37,800
Because a demon
hurts girls in this town.

91
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:40,000
We're Hunters.

92
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,319
We catch demons.

93
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,399
Yuanchu.

94
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,800
show her.

95
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:56,759
Please,

96
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,600
please save my sister!

97
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:00,800
She's pregnant with a demon's child.

98
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,040
They took her

99
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,000
for "the Blessing."

100
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,160
Pregnant with a demon's child?

101
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:08,240
That happened to lots of women
in our town.

102
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:11,000
After they were taken,
they never came back.

103
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,160
What about your parents?

104
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,360
I am an orphan.

105
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:17,000
My sister raised me.

106
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:19,800
She wears a wooden hairpin

107
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,079
with a little cat carved on it.

108
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,839
I made that for her.

109
00:06:24,319 --> 00:06:25,120
Lanxi,

110
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,560
I am sorry.

111
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,800
I have made you

112
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,680
worry about me again.

113
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:35,000
Sister...

114
00:06:44,279 --> 00:06:47,360
Don't worry. We'll find your sister.

115
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:51,199
After we leave,

116
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:53,079
lock all your doors and windows.

117
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,519
Here.

118
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:59,480
Put this talisman up in your home.

119
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,199
Don't let anyone take it down except us.

120
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,000
Got it?

121
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,120
Mm.

122
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:11,759
I didn't know you had such a soft heart.

123
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,040
Like a cat that hisses
but curls up in your lap.

124
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:17,240
My favorite kind.

125
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,360
I have a plan.

126
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,920
Since this demon preys on women,

127
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:41,399
I'll lure it out.

128
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,639
Back in the Void Realm,

129
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,680
I could make blind demons see,

130
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,040
lame demons walk,

131
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:49,199
monk demons break their vows.

132
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:53,120
Everyone knew the courtesan
of Lanruo Hall.

133
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:55,759
No, that is way too dangerous.

134
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:57,839
We should find the others first

135
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,199
and gather more clues.

136
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,839
So are you worried that I will run away,

137
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,720
or are you worried about me?

138
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:09,920
I...

139
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,319
I'm worried about the demon.

140
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:14,279
If it sees through you,

141
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,480
it'll be harder to catch it.

142
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,920
Demons are stubborn.

143
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,480
Now that it's breeding demon children,

144
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,040
it won't stop.

145
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:24,240
No one knows demons better than me.

146
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,800
I will use my Spirit-Calling Art
to control it.

147
00:08:28,319 --> 00:08:30,680
As for you, to avoid scaring it off,

148
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,720
you show up later.

149
00:08:32,759 --> 00:08:33,799
But this...

150
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:35,159
if you do not untie it for me,

151
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,759
how am I supposed to lure the demon out?

152
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,320
Untie.

153
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,639
Let me make this clear:

154
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:53,799
I am only doing this to save lives.

155
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,000
Once we catch the demon,

156
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,200
I will chain you again.

157
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:58,080
Then you'd better keep your eyes on me.

158
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:59,360
Don't lose me.

159
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:10,879
Wind Cleaver.

160
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:20,080
Blessings from heaven.

161
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,840
Blessings from heaven.

162
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,759
Evil passes on.

163
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,360
Evil passes on.

164
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:27,360
Pure bliss!

165
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,840
Pure bliss!

166
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,960
Fortune comes!

167
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,600
Fortune comes!

168
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,480
Blessings from heaven.

169
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,120
Blessings from heaven.

170
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,919
Evil passes on.

171
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,399
Evil passes on.

172
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,279
Pure bliss!

173
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:42,759
Pure bliss!

174
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,320
Fortune comes!

175
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,679
If I can't lure the demon out,

176
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,679
I will go in as the bait myself.

177
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:53,200
Young Taoist's unchaining spell
works pretty well.

178
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,960
So many women have suffered here.

179
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,480
Suizi, Suizi.

180
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,840
Suizi, Suizi.

181
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,960
Who are you?

182
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:31,000
What on earth happened here?

183
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,240
I am a physician in the town.

184
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:36,200
All these years,

185
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:39,200
young women in town
kept getting pregnant with demon kids.

186
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:42,080
The townsfolk,
following a sage's advice,

187
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:44,039
to ward off evil,

188
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:48,679
burned them all alive.

189
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,639
They called it,

190
00:10:52,519 --> 00:10:53,320
"the Blessing."

191
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,200
Miss,

192
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,039
please,

193
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,720
please kill me.

194
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,039
Kill you?

195
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,919
It is all my fault.

196
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,639
I got her killed.

197
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,799
I got all of them killed.

198
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:11,720
I was afraid of being cast out,

199
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:15,080
so I made medicine

200
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:18,039
for them to use on those women.

201
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,759
For so many years,

202
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,240
I pretended not to see or hear.

203
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:23,720
I numbed myself.

204
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:27,559
Until they made me do it to her.

205
00:11:28,639 --> 00:11:32,279
She and I grew up together.

206
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,440
We were childhood sweethearts.

207
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:37,360
We promised

208
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,559
once we saved enough,

209
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,360
we'd take Xiao Maizi

210
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:43,039
and travel the world.

211
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,679
We'd heal the sick.

212
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:48,440
It is all my fault.

213
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,799
I was just too cowardly.

214
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:53,240
I even lied to myself.

215
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,320
(I carry a demon kid. I deserve to die.)
I convinced myself she was a demon.

216
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,159
(My sister's young. Please protect her.)
So I could feel justified.

217
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:00,480
Now,

218
00:12:01,039 --> 00:12:03,000
I can finally admit I loved her.

219
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:06,240
But it's too late, Miss.

220
00:12:06,919 --> 00:12:08,720
I know my sins are unforgivable.

221
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,559
Here's the key to the secret chamber.

222
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,519
Set those women free.

223
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Then kill me.

224
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:19,480
I hate that I don't even
have the courage to die.

225
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:24,759
I won't kill you.

226
00:12:25,679 --> 00:12:27,200
You must live on.

227
00:12:28,039 --> 00:12:31,519
Living with guilt
will be your punishment.

228
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,200
(The rest of my life...)
(Yuanchu...)

229
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:09,480
(If I ever face the same fate someday,)

230
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,550
(what would you do?)

231
00:13:12,799 --> 00:13:16,519
We are honored to
have a Taoist visit our town.

232
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:19,559
A demoness is bringing disaster upon us.

233
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,840
We beg you to rid our town of this evil.

234
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,759
We pray for the master's blessing

235
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,840
and slay the demon!

236
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:33,159
Bless our town!

237
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:36,240
Let all darkness hide.

238
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,399
Let all filth fade.

239
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:40,360
Let all darkness hide.

240
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:42,360
Let all filth fade.

241
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,159
Yuanchu?

242
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:44,440
Let plagues retreat to the wilds.

243
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,480
Let seas of sin grow calm.

244
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,320
Let plagues retreat to the wilds.

245
00:13:48,919 --> 00:13:50,360
Let seas of sin grow calm.

246
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:52,360
Stars light the path ahead.

247
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,480
Break through the fog of lies.

248
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,240
Stars light the path ahead.

249
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,120
Break through the fog of lies.

250
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,000
Bells ring through the night,

251
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,320
all evil bows.

252
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,600
Young Taoist.

253
00:14:02,799 --> 00:14:03,480
You...

254
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,840
Bells ring through the night.

255
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:06,080
As a cultivator,

256
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,600
I must uphold the will of heaven.

257
00:14:08,919 --> 00:14:10,440
No shadow of evil shall harm.

258
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,639
Compassion's banner shields us all.

259
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,600
No shadow of evil shall harm.

260
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,559
Everything you saw
in that ritual hall...

261
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,360
I know it all.

262
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,039
Eyes and Ears.

263
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:48,559
You were spying on me, pesky Taoist!

264
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:52,519
Now that we know the truth,

265
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:56,720
let's figure out
what to do with these murderers.

266
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,159
I already told you.

267
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,559
Uphold the will of heaven.

268
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:25,320
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

269
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:28,370
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

270
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:32,480
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

271
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,620
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

272
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:42,550
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

273
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:50,140
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

274
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:54,460
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

275
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:58,220
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

276
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:05,200
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
